    "confidence": 0.95,
    "explanation": "To both parties: the SGD 9.40 in dispute is not a no-show or cancellation charge, and no clause in this category refunds it. The fare ledger (EV-FARE-00705) itemises the SGD 9.40 as the completed-trip fare for TRP-00705 — base SGD 3.80 + distance SGD 2.45 + time SGD 2.35 + platform fee SGD 0.80, over 2.3 km and 12.0 minutes — collected under an upfront quote of SGD 9.40, with total_charged 9.40. The cancellation-fee line is SGD 0.00, waiting_time_fee is SGD 0, refund_issued_sgd is SGD 0.00 and payment_status is CHARGED. The trip record (EV-TRIP-00705) shows status COMPLETED, with cancelled_at, cancelled_by and cancellation_reason_code all null. Nothing was charged under POL-NS-01, so there is no fee line for the rider's demand to reach.\n\nRider: your POL-NS-01 and POL-NS-06 arguments are accepted on their arithmetic but buy you nothing. Limb (d) does fail — the trip was never terminated for RIDER_NO_SHOW, RIDER_UNREACHABLE or EXCESSIVE_WAIT — and the in-geofence dwell was 50 seconds against the 300-second STANDARD minimum, a shortfall of 250 seconds under limb (c). But the only remedy those clauses give is a refund of the cancellation fee, and that line is SGD 0.00, so there is no money for POL-NS-06 to return; the SGD 9.40 you ask back is the completed-trip fare. Your account that the driver demanded cash to wait is not in the record: EV-CHAT-00705 holds 0 messages, EV-TRIP-00705 records chat_message_count 0 and no in-app calls, and your own claim concedes no separate cash waiting payment was made. The scheduled no-show figure of SGD 4.00 in the ledger's derived block is likewise not chargeable — and, importantly, was never charged.\n\nDriver: your position that the charge stands is accepted. The arrival marker was true: at the recorded arrival the trace places you 1.13 m from the pin and stationary, so POL-NS-05 is not engaged and no false-arrival referral arises. POL-NS-02 is satisfied (6 consecutive qualifying in-geofence fixes, 100% coverage, 0.0 s max gap). POL-NS-07 yields no compensation because 80% of a SGD 0.00 cancellation fee is SGD 0.00, and the anti-farming check does not trip (1 no-show termination against 110 completed trips, failing both the 4-or-more and the above-8% limbs).\n\nOn weight and escalation: the deciding artifacts, EV-TRIP-00705 and EV-FARE-00705, are both COMPLETE at weight 1.0, so the confidence cap is 1.0. Nothing is impaired under POL-NS-08 — the 10-second gap between the arrival event and the first fix is far under the 90-second clock-skew threshold, the trace has 78 fixes and no gap over 120 seconds, the empty chat matches chat_message_count 0 (no missing sequence or truncation), and the fare lines reconcile. EV-ADVIS-00705-01 is MISSING at weight 0.0; both sides cite it only as an absence, it carries no fact, and its absence is not needed by the outcome. No POL-NS-09 trigger fires: confidence is above the 0.70 floor, the admissible artifacts do not contradict each other on arrival, dwell or rider presence, there are no repeat-party disputes (both disputes_with_counterparty_90d are 0), and rider_profile.no_show_disputes_30d is 0. Confidence is 0.95.\n\nOutcome: the rider's claim is not supported by the evidence, and the present state stands — no refund to the rider and no driver compensation."
  },
  "discarded_claims": []
}

